OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter trial paused due to
OL,4,Alinks to crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned e-scooter rental scheme has
OL,7,Fbeen paused in Bradford so the council
OL,8,Fcan "get on top" of a problem with them
OL,9,Fbeing ridden illegally in the city.
OL,11,FThe upcoming trial would have seen
OL,12,Fabout 50 of the electric bikes for hire
OL,13,Fbut Bradford Council said due to links
OL,14,Fto theft and anti-social behaviour, the
OL,15,Fproject was not going ahead until the
OL,16,Fissues had been resolved.
OL,18,FPrivately owned e-scooters are illegal
OL,19,Fto ride on all public roads, pavements
OL,20,Fand shared spaces but still remain a
OL,21,Fcommon sight in the city centre.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
