OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter trial paused due to
OL,4,Alinks to crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority said although it
OL,7,Fhad permission from the Department of
OL,8,FTransport to start the scheme, it did
OL,9,Fnot want "legal and illegal scooters
OL,10,Fhere at the same time".
